Port of macos/Sources/MalachiMail/AccountWizard/Jira/JiraCredentialsPageController.swift;
GTK: jira_wizard.blp credentials_page. The assistant's sign-in page
(Jira.CredentialFields): the banner across the top, then a scrolling column
clamped to 480 px with 24 px margins: the help text (dim, wrapping; Jira
Cloud only) and "Create API Token…" under it, which opens
id.atlassian.com, 18 px above the rows: the Atlassian account's address
(Jira Cloud; fixed when an account is edited) and the token; at the bottom
the call under way and Next (Save when editing).
